WEBVTT

00:05.714 --> 00:08.174
TOKYO REVENGERS

01:35.345 --> 01:38.890
If I win, I'll take over BLACK DRAGON.

02:02.747 --> 02:04.249
I'm not through yet.

02:12.423 --> 02:14.801
Stop doing this, Takemichi.

02:18.513 --> 02:22.100
I'm not... through yet.

02:25.812 --> 02:29.482
You can't change anything, damn it!

02:36.156 --> 02:37.782
<i>I had nothing.</i>

02:38.700 --> 02:42.203
<i>No friends to confide in
and nobody to love.</i>

02:45.540 --> 02:46.833
<i>I was all alone.</i>

02:51.462 --> 02:52.463
Takemichi.

02:53.381 --> 02:54.757
You're wrong.

03:15.945 --> 03:17.030
Hakkai.

03:20.158 --> 03:22.076
You're the one who can't change.

03:23.620 --> 03:25.205
<i>The first time</i>

03:26.206 --> 03:30.084
<i>I swore to change the future
was when Akkun died.</i>

03:31.294 --> 03:33.588
<i>I was on a dirty stairway in a back alley.</i>

03:34.547 --> 03:37.050
<i>I felt like I had to shoulder
the whole burden alone.</i>

03:37.717 --> 03:40.220
<i>I was so afraid and anxious,
it was overwhelming.</i>

03:42.513 --> 03:45.266
I want to save everyone.

03:45.767 --> 03:48.144
<i>But little by little...</i>

03:48.228 --> 03:50.146
Dude, you're awesome.

03:50.230 --> 03:53.233
You actually got those two to make up.

03:54.651 --> 03:55.693
Take care of Draken!

03:55.777 --> 03:57.904
A hundred million yen on Takemitchy.

03:57.987 --> 03:59.656
Crybaby hero.

03:59.739 --> 04:01.824
I leave it in your hands.

04:02.617 --> 04:04.369
<i>They all accepted me.</i>

04:04.869 --> 04:06.537
Takemichi Hanagaki!

04:06.621 --> 04:10.458
I appoint you captain of First Division!

04:10.959 --> 04:13.127
Thanks, Takemitchy.

04:13.211 --> 04:16.047
Thank you, Takemitchy.

04:17.173 --> 04:18.341
I leave Toman...

04:19.759 --> 04:21.344
to you, partner.

04:29.602 --> 04:32.605
That's enough, Takemichi!
You're going to die!

04:36.317 --> 04:37.819
<i>If I stand my ground now,</i>

04:38.611 --> 04:40.738
<i>I may not change the future.</i>

04:42.907 --> 04:45.702
<i>But if there's even
the slightest chance...</i>

05:03.094 --> 05:05.346
That wouldn't hurt a flea.

05:09.767 --> 05:11.728
What happened, Boss?

05:12.729 --> 05:13.563
No way.

05:19.944 --> 05:21.237
I'm not through yet.

05:22.071 --> 05:25.616
Takemichi... Please, just give up.

05:27.618 --> 05:28.911
If there's a chance...

05:29.954 --> 05:31.581
I can change the future...

05:33.583 --> 05:36.127
it's worth risking your life,
don't you think?

05:36.210 --> 05:37.337
Huh?

05:38.254 --> 05:41.883
Hakkai, fighting your hardest
isn't painful.

05:44.344 --> 05:46.012
What's most painful is...

05:47.096 --> 05:48.306
being all alone.

05:51.768 --> 05:54.270
You can talk to me about anything, Hakkai.

05:55.438 --> 05:58.024
We're... friends, after all.

06:04.614 --> 06:05.656
Takemitchy...

06:07.533 --> 06:08.368
Please...

06:09.535 --> 06:11.079
Save me.

06:15.458 --> 06:16.292
Boss?

06:18.920 --> 06:21.255
That bastard brought
the boss to his knees.

06:26.719 --> 06:29.889
Toman captains are plenty badass.

06:30.473 --> 06:32.892
Holy shit, partner.

06:34.477 --> 06:36.813
Help me, Takemitchy.

06:37.730 --> 06:38.856
Help me.

06:39.774 --> 06:41.901
Leave it to me, Hakkai.

06:49.742 --> 06:50.701
Hakkai.

06:51.285 --> 06:53.121
The thing you wanted to protect...

06:54.705 --> 06:57.458
Yuzuha, who you
still protect in the future...

06:58.584 --> 07:00.920
I will protect her.

07:05.591 --> 07:08.344
That's not how it is, Takemitchy.

07:11.055 --> 07:13.975
There's not a single bruise
on my face, right?

07:16.936 --> 07:20.189
But Yuzuha, she's been beaten to a pulp.

07:22.150 --> 07:23.067
Huh?

07:26.821 --> 07:30.283
Use your strength to protect others.

07:32.577 --> 07:34.537
I made a promise then...

07:35.121 --> 07:36.456
to protect my family.

07:39.167 --> 07:40.585
I wanted to protect her.

07:43.087 --> 07:46.549
I wanted to protect Yuzuha,

07:47.592 --> 07:50.887
but I didn't have the courage
to defy Taiju.

07:52.263 --> 07:53.264
Huh?

07:54.265 --> 07:58.102
It was the opposite.
She always protected me.

08:00.229 --> 08:02.899
Everything I said was a lie.

08:04.650 --> 08:06.486
Then, from now on,

08:07.069 --> 08:10.281
you'll take the beatings for two.

08:13.159 --> 08:14.994
You're good with that, right?

08:15.077 --> 08:16.037
Yuzuha?

08:21.542 --> 08:22.376
What?

08:22.460 --> 08:26.172
It was Yuzuha
who did the protecting this whole time.

08:29.050 --> 08:30.176
Yuzuha?

08:31.802 --> 08:34.430
You mean, this whole time...

08:36.474 --> 08:39.060
Don't mess with my little brother!

08:39.644 --> 08:43.231
I will... protect Hakkai.

08:45.066 --> 08:47.109
She protected you?

08:48.736 --> 08:51.030
You mean, you lied about

08:51.864 --> 08:54.492
protecting your family this whole time

08:55.243 --> 08:57.703
even though you promised to
the day you met Mitsuya?

09:01.165 --> 09:01.999
Taiju,

09:02.625 --> 09:04.919
why are you beating on Hakkai?

09:05.002 --> 09:07.004
You're breaking your promise.

09:07.088 --> 09:08.422
Promise?

09:08.506 --> 09:12.343
You were just using that as an excuse.

09:12.426 --> 09:14.554
So I had to discipline him.

09:15.972 --> 09:18.140
Both of you, come here!

09:27.817 --> 09:28.651
I...

09:30.278 --> 09:35.616
I made it sound like
I did the things that Yuzuha had done.

09:39.579 --> 09:42.373
That's totally shitty.

09:44.417 --> 09:45.668
Loser.

09:48.129 --> 09:50.006
Don't say any more, Hakkai.

09:50.089 --> 09:54.760
It's lame enough
that you had to be protected by a woman.

09:54.844 --> 09:56.762
But you even lied about protecting her.

09:56.846 --> 09:58.472
What a lowlife.

09:58.556 --> 10:00.474
You stay the hell out of this!

10:00.558 --> 10:03.811
It was my decision. Hakkai's not to blame.

10:05.521 --> 10:07.231
Forgive me, Takemitchy.

10:08.232 --> 10:10.484
It's all my fault that this has happened.

10:12.153 --> 10:14.196
I got you all caught up in my lies.

10:14.947 --> 10:19.076
I'm simply too damn afraid of Taiju,
so my only choice was to stab him.

10:20.328 --> 10:22.580
I did it to run from my own weakness.

10:28.336 --> 10:29.170
Hakkai,

10:30.379 --> 10:31.672
you suck!

10:33.674 --> 10:37.511
But don't think that
you're the only person who sucks.

10:38.804 --> 10:40.723
I sucked even worse.

10:41.265 --> 10:44.226
You really do suck, Hakkai.

10:44.727 --> 10:49.982
I acted like a hotshot when I said
not to hate the life you were born into.

10:50.858 --> 10:53.694
But in reality, I freaking hated mine.

10:55.655 --> 10:58.574
One time,
I became so fed up with all of it

10:59.158 --> 11:01.243
that I ran off,
leaving both my sisters behind.

11:01.869 --> 11:05.831
When I came back home,
my mom slapped me hard.

11:05.915 --> 11:07.041
Lame, huh?

11:08.626 --> 11:12.421
But after that, my mom gave me a hug.

11:13.255 --> 11:15.466
She cried and said,
"I'm sorry for all this."

11:18.010 --> 11:19.970
You're not the only one who's run away.

11:21.222 --> 11:24.016
We're all weak.
But that's why we've got friends.

11:26.185 --> 11:28.729
We won't abandon you for lying like that.

11:30.398 --> 11:32.525
That's what Toman's all about.

11:52.086 --> 11:53.838
Everyone, step back.

11:55.172 --> 11:56.048
Taka.

11:57.174 --> 11:58.008
Chifuyu.

11:59.009 --> 11:59.844
Takemitchy.

12:01.053 --> 12:02.972
You're all beat to shit.

12:04.223 --> 12:06.851
I'm not afraid anymore. Thank you.

12:08.185 --> 12:09.353
Hakkai...

12:15.609 --> 12:19.113
I'm never wearing
that BLACK DRAGON uniform again.

12:23.534 --> 12:27.204
So, you've fooled yourself
into thinking you're tough now, huh?

12:28.998 --> 12:32.168
I'm the one who's protected our family.

12:32.668 --> 12:37.506
How dare you defy your brother
who's protected the Shiba family!

12:37.590 --> 12:38.674
Don't, Taiju!

12:38.758 --> 12:40.176
Don't you touch Hakkai!

12:42.219 --> 12:43.971
Huh? Hakkai?

12:46.140 --> 12:49.185
Tokyo Manji Gang,
Second Division Vice Captain,

12:49.268 --> 12:50.519
Hakkai Shiba.

12:51.103 --> 12:54.940
To protect Yuzuha, my friends,
and my family,

12:55.024 --> 12:57.067
I'll beat your ass!

13:04.450 --> 13:06.452
Hakkai's changed.

13:06.535 --> 13:07.369
Yeah.

13:07.453 --> 13:10.331
He didn't say "kill." He said "beat."

13:11.415 --> 13:13.751
This will change the future, Takemitchy.

13:29.809 --> 13:33.145
God, must you continue to test me?

13:38.484 --> 13:43.030
Must I really kill
the two members of my family?

13:43.531 --> 13:46.116
Even though I love them so much?

13:46.200 --> 13:47.535
I love them.

13:47.618 --> 13:49.411
I love them.

13:49.495 --> 13:50.329
Hakkai!

13:52.414 --> 13:53.541
Goddamn monster.

13:55.209 --> 13:56.335
Hakkai!

13:57.336 --> 13:59.713
What a shame, Hakkai.

14:01.382 --> 14:03.801
You're not getting out of here alive.

14:04.301 --> 14:06.303
It's hopeless trying to run.

14:06.846 --> 14:09.932
My soldiers have this church surrounded.

14:10.015 --> 14:11.892
MURDER SQUAD

14:14.687 --> 14:16.647
He's right, Takemitchy.

14:16.730 --> 14:18.148
There's a hundred of them.

14:18.649 --> 14:20.818
I never planned on running away.

14:21.569 --> 14:25.906
Chifuyu, unless we defeat this guy
and all of BLACK DRAGON,

14:25.990 --> 14:27.658
the future won't change.

14:32.162 --> 14:35.207
You're right about that, Takemitchy.

14:35.291 --> 14:37.209
Guess we're going to die.

14:37.293 --> 14:38.252
That's right.

14:38.752 --> 14:41.547
What's wrong with you?
Why are you smiling?

14:41.630 --> 14:45.259
Are you insane?
You could really die, you know?

14:45.843 --> 14:46.719
Sorry.

14:48.762 --> 14:50.973
My expectations for him made him suffer.

14:52.641 --> 14:53.934
I'm a failure as a big brother.

14:55.102 --> 14:55.936
Mitsuya...

14:57.271 --> 15:01.108
You protected Hakkai
all by yourself, Yuzuha.

15:02.776 --> 15:04.069
I seriously respect you for that.

15:11.035 --> 15:12.912
Now, it's our turn.

15:16.540 --> 15:17.374
Yuzuha.

15:18.042 --> 15:18.876
Yes?

15:19.418 --> 15:21.211
Do you like Daddy?

15:23.672 --> 15:24.506
I don't know.

15:25.090 --> 15:27.009
I almost never talk to him.

15:27.843 --> 15:28.969
He's never home.

15:31.972 --> 15:34.058
I'm sorry, Yuzuha.

15:36.810 --> 15:38.520
I will protect you, Yuzuha.

15:40.272 --> 15:41.607
It's okay.

15:41.690 --> 15:43.692
Don't you worry about home, Mommy.

15:44.777 --> 15:47.488
You just get better fast.

15:49.406 --> 15:52.076
<i>Not long after that, my mom died.</i>

15:53.077 --> 15:56.121
Mommy, Hakkai started
elementary school today.

15:56.705 --> 15:59.041
He's so happy to have his own backpack

15:59.124 --> 16:01.460
that he even wears it
when he goes out to play.

16:02.044 --> 16:03.087
Isn't that crazy?

16:03.587 --> 16:06.465
ANCESTRAL TOMB

16:07.383 --> 16:09.301
Don't you worry, Mommy.

16:09.385 --> 16:11.345
I'll protect our family.

16:17.267 --> 16:18.852
So, someday...

16:20.813 --> 16:23.482
Someday, please hug me again.

16:25.776 --> 16:29.571
<i>Not long after Mom died,
Taiju started beating us.</i>

16:30.197 --> 16:32.616
<i>Every day without end.</i>

16:33.117 --> 16:36.370
Who forgot to turn off the bathroom light?

16:38.664 --> 16:39.498
Well...

16:39.581 --> 16:40.708
Me.

16:41.417 --> 16:42.251
Huh?

16:43.043 --> 16:45.254
Hey, how come you're lying?

16:45.337 --> 16:47.423
What? I'm not lying. I did--

16:47.506 --> 16:49.341
The seat was up.

16:49.925 --> 16:52.177
Only boys lift the seat up.

16:53.762 --> 16:55.806
-Come with me, Hakkai!
-Wait!

16:55.889 --> 16:57.683
Don't beat Hakkai!

16:57.766 --> 17:00.269
I'll take the beating for him.

17:01.812 --> 17:02.855
Yuzuha...

17:04.857 --> 17:05.983
Please!

17:08.277 --> 17:10.571
Then, from now on,

17:11.280 --> 17:14.616
you'll take the beatings for two.

17:15.659 --> 17:16.493
<i>This whole time...</i>

17:17.369 --> 17:19.329
<i>I protected our family alone.</i>

17:30.716 --> 17:32.593
TETTA KISAKI

17:35.387 --> 17:37.014
Protect Hakkai.

17:38.098 --> 17:40.559
<i>So I jumped at the chance Kisaki gave me.</i>

17:41.518 --> 17:43.979
<i>I had to do it by myself.</i>

17:49.985 --> 17:51.612
Let's protect Hakkai!

18:07.044 --> 18:09.296
You okay, Takemitchy?

18:09.379 --> 18:11.340
Yeah. Thanks, man.

18:16.720 --> 18:18.472
I'm sorry, Hakkai.

18:19.098 --> 18:20.182
I'm sorry.

18:21.600 --> 18:22.434
Yuzuha...

18:23.227 --> 18:25.312
I swear I'll protect you.

18:26.271 --> 18:28.190
I swear it. I'll protect you.

18:28.982 --> 18:31.360
I'll protect you in Mommy's place.

18:42.287 --> 18:45.124
I swear I'll protect Yuzuha.

18:55.342 --> 18:56.385
Yuzuha.

18:58.929 --> 19:00.264
See? You're not alone.

19:09.606 --> 19:11.692
<i>Thank you, you guys.</i>

19:15.779 --> 19:16.697
Damn it!

19:16.780 --> 19:19.283
My leg's messed up, Takemitchy.

19:34.339 --> 19:35.799
Sorry, Takemitchy.

19:36.300 --> 19:40.262
You're way past your limit, aren't you?

19:40.762 --> 19:43.640
You're a fool, Hakkai.

19:43.724 --> 19:46.643
You've ended up losing everything.

19:49.188 --> 19:50.772
Get lost, you asshole.

19:52.024 --> 19:54.610
I hope you learn
your lesson in hell, scumbag.

19:55.277 --> 19:56.695
That'll wake you up.

20:19.259 --> 20:20.177
I'm not through yet.

20:21.428 --> 20:25.349
I still haven't taken
half as much as Takemitchy has.

20:25.432 --> 20:26.308
I'm not through.

20:27.267 --> 20:29.686
I'm not through yet!

20:39.029 --> 20:41.406
I'm even starting to hear things.

20:54.002 --> 20:55.087
This sound...

20:56.380 --> 20:57.673
Mikey's CB250T.

20:59.424 --> 21:00.259
Huh?

21:04.721 --> 21:06.181
Mikey?

21:11.186 --> 21:13.188
Mikey?

21:13.272 --> 21:16.400
What's Toman's boss doing here?

21:19.903 --> 21:21.697
<i>Mikey's come.</i>

21:22.572 --> 21:23.699
<i>Who called him?</i>

21:25.659 --> 21:28.161
<i>Now we're saved.</i>

21:29.162 --> 21:30.831
With Mikey here,

21:31.832 --> 21:33.458
we can defeat BLACK DRAGON.

21:34.126 --> 21:35.502
I wouldn't be so sure.

21:35.585 --> 21:36.420
Huh?

21:36.503 --> 21:41.967
We're only here because we broke the truce
between Toman and BLACK DRAGON.

21:43.552 --> 21:45.554
What will Mikey think of that?

22:04.948 --> 22:06.199
Just what...

22:06.783 --> 22:09.286
are you guys doing on this day?

23:38.375 --> 23:40.377
Translation by Brian Athey
